@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Cliente / Utilizador" as User

node "Infraestrutura Distribuída" {
    component "Componente 1: Gestão de Aeronaves" as Comp1
    database "Base de Dados 1" as DB1

    component "Componente 2: Aeroportos" as Comp2
    database "Base de Dados 2" as DB2

    component "Componente 3: Rotas e Voos" as Comp3
    database "Base de Dados 3" as DB3
}

User --> Comp1 : HTTP/REST
User --> Comp2 : HTTP/REST
User --> Comp3 : HTTP/REST

Comp1 --> DB1 : JDBC / JPA
Comp2 --> DB2 : JDBC / JPA
Comp3 --> DB3 : JDBC / JPA

Comp3 ..> Comp1 : HTTP/REST (Colaboração / Forwarding)[cite: 25]
@enduml